1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Over the mountains and across the valleys

2
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
Like a plane, the ninja flies freely through the sky

3
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind, Hattori-kun brings joy to all

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
With eyes wide open and mouth shut tight

5
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Face covered up and cheeks puffed out

6
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains, agile and fast as lightning

7
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Tricking bad guys with quirky new moves like magic

8
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking politely like poetry, full of spirit

9
00:00:31,796 --> 00:00:35,149
"I'm Going on an Outing"

10
00:00:42,832 --> 00:00:43,752
Kenichi

11
00:00:43,803 --> 00:00:46,520
You're packing, are you planning on going somewhere?

12
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,543
Oh no, tomorrow is Sunday

13
00:00:48,586 --> 00:00:50,852
The teacher is taking us on a field trip to the countryside

14
00:00:50,909 --> 00:00:52,372
Kenichi, I want to go too

15
00:00:52,422 --> 00:00:53,706
Kemumaki is going too, you know

16
00:00:53,756 --> 00:00:56,410
When you two see each other, you're bound to start fighting

17
00:00:56,461 --> 00:00:59,672
If I don't fight him, will you take me with you?

18
00:00:59,722 --> 00:01:02,894
If you ignore him, then I'll take you along

19
00:01:04,275 --> 00:01:06,805
Alright then, I promise not to fight him

20
00:01:06,849 --> 00:01:07,952
Your word is your bond

21
00:01:07,993 --> 00:01:09,620
I can make a pinky swear

22
00:01:09,661 --> 00:01:11,566
-Alright, let's pinky swear
-Pinky swear

23
00:01:11,607 --> 00:01:12,670
A pinky swear as our bond...

24
00:01:12,711 --> 00:01:14,644
Break our promise, may heaven strike us down

25
00:01:14,684 --> 00:01:17,185
We accept our punishment and will never break our word

26
00:01:30,724 --> 00:01:32,237
Here, giving this back to you

27
00:01:35,868 --> 00:01:38,348
Good morning, Mrs. Mitsuba, is Kenichi around?

28
00:01:38,635 --> 00:01:40,026
Good morning, Kemumaki

29
00:01:40,067 --> 00:01:40,922
Kenichi

30
00:01:40,972 --> 00:01:42,535
Kemumaki is here to see you

31
00:01:42,576 --> 00:01:43,305
Coming!

32
00:01:43,346 --> 00:01:44,512
Remember, Hattori-kun

33
00:01:44,562 --> 00:01:46,267
When you make a promise, you have to keep it

34
00:01:46,308 --> 00:01:48,332
A ninja never breaks a promise

35
00:01:48,382 --> 00:01:51,371
Enduring even when it's unbearable is what makes a true ninja

36
00:01:52,050 --> 00:01:53,292
I'm off to school!

37
00:01:53,333 --> 00:01:55,433
Alright then, be careful on the way

38
00:01:55,474 --> 00:01:56,634
-Yes!
-Yes!

39
00:01:58,153 --> 00:02:00,537
Hey, Iga ninja, let's duel!

40
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,923
Hey... fight me right now!

41
00:02:04,459 --> 00:02:06,129
Forget it, Kemumaki, don't fight

42
00:02:06,179 --> 00:02:08,830
Hattori-kun promised me he wouldn't fight you today

43
00:02:08,881 --> 00:02:10,920
What? Hmph, I'm not letting him off!

44
00:02:12,592 --> 00:02:14,720
Yan...

45
00:02:15,096 --> 00:02:16,354
Even if you don't want to duel with me

46
00:02:16,404 --> 00:02:18,021
I'm still going to fight you!

47
00:02:18,693 --> 00:02:20,937
Oh no... please don't...

48
00:02:22,517 --> 00:02:24,106
You bad dog, get out of here!

49
00:02:27,107 --> 00:02:29,750
Oh? It's a Koga ninja cat

50
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:37,306
Don't do it, Hattori-kun

51
00:02:37,356 --> 00:02:39,086
You promised me you wouldn't fight

52
00:02:39,136 --> 00:02:40,180
It has nothing to do with him

53
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:42,539
Koga and Iga are completely incompatible

54
00:02:42,589 --> 00:02:43,540
Shishimaru

55
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:45,681
You and Shinzo were supposed to watch the house

56
00:02:47,256 --> 00:02:48,279
I won't let you stay here

57
00:02:48,329 --> 00:02:49,729
Hurry up and go home

58
00:02:51,814 --> 00:02:53,738
Kemumaki, tell your cat to go back

59
00:02:53,779 --> 00:02:55,667
Whether I send him back is my business

60
00:02:55,714 --> 00:02:56,861
What is it to you?

61
00:02:58,999 --> 00:02:59,994
Hurry up

62
00:03:00,044 --> 00:03:00,948
I'm so sorry

63
00:03:00,988 --> 00:03:03,174
I overslept this morning and didn't wake up in time

64
00:03:03,276 --> 00:03:04,527
If it were Kenichi...

65
00:03:04,577 --> 00:03:06,287
I wouldn't forgive him

66
00:03:06,337 --> 00:03:07,999
It's fine since it's you

67
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:09,120
Thank you

68
00:03:09,556 --> 00:03:11,412
Why does Kemumaki get such special treatment?

69
00:03:11,477 --> 00:03:14,200
It's so unfair! Hey, wait for me!

70
00:03:29,646 --> 00:03:31,263
Look at all this trash!

71
00:03:31,313 --> 00:03:33,440
Rubbish belongs in the bin

72
00:03:33,846 --> 00:03:36,273
All right, let's picnic here

73
00:03:36,331 --> 00:03:37,772
- Okay
- Okay

74
00:03:38,961 --> 00:03:40,807
So much food!

75
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:44,266
Here, let's eat over here

76
00:03:44,569 --> 00:03:46,653
I'm getting really hungry

77
00:03:46,707 --> 00:03:49,365
I can go from morning till night without food or water

78
00:03:49,416 --> 00:03:52,160
You're highly skilled, Hattori-kun, so of course you're an exception

79
00:03:52,211 --> 00:03:53,513
Oh, we've run out of water

80
00:03:53,563 --> 00:03:54,945
Let me go fetch some

81
00:03:54,996 --> 00:03:56,728
I'll go with you

82
00:03:56,922 --> 00:03:58,477
Kemumaki, you stay here

83
00:03:58,517 --> 00:03:59,499
Stay right here, don't go

84
00:03:59,543 --> 00:04:02,015
Kenichi, take him along with you

85
00:04:02,056 --> 00:04:03,687
No way! See you later

86
00:04:03,743 --> 00:04:05,263
Yan...

87
00:04:05,314 --> 00:04:06,830
Never mind then, Kemumaki

88
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,913
Let's get ready to eat, shall we?

89
00:04:08,964 --> 00:04:09,920
Okay

90
00:04:10,853 --> 00:04:13,240
Wow, this looks and smells delicious!

91
00:04:15,825 --> 00:04:17,503
Oh no, it rolled down!

92
00:04:22,832 --> 00:04:24,306
Found a water source!

93
00:04:26,075 --> 00:04:27,502
The water is so clear

94
00:04:29,835 --> 00:04:31,061
Kenichi!

95
00:04:31,111 --> 00:04:32,821
Oh? Who could that be?

96
00:04:32,935 --> 00:04:34,680
No one can stop us now

97
00:04:36,775 --> 00:04:39,212
You and I are destined to be mortal enemies

98
00:04:39,268 --> 00:04:40,442
It's either you or me

99
00:04:40,482 --> 00:04:41,961
There's no other way

100
00:04:42,012 --> 00:04:43,127
Take this!

101
00:04:43,514 --> 00:04:45,931
Yan...

102
00:04:45,981 --> 00:04:47,758
Outrageous! You don't want to fight, is that it?

103
00:04:47,808 --> 00:04:50,320
You think you can just hide? Spinning Shuriken!

104
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,042
Yan...

105
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:53,659
Success!

106
00:04:53,978 --> 00:04:55,543
Tied up by my killer ropes...

107
00:04:55,584 --> 00:04:57,105
...you've got no chance of escaping

108
00:04:57,993 --> 00:04:59,591
How about that, Iga ninja?

109
00:05:03,474 --> 00:05:05,089
Impressive skills, as expected

110
00:05:05,269 --> 00:05:06,610
Let's go again!

111
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:10,269
Hey, don't run away!

112
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,080
Don't run, Iga ninja!

113
00:05:15,648 --> 00:05:16,868
Got you!

114
00:05:19,735 --> 00:05:20,905
This makes no sense at all

115
00:05:20,955 --> 00:05:22,020
Why aren't you resisting at all...

116
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:23,576
...and letting me catch you so easily?

117
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:25,381
Can't you take this seriously?

118
00:05:26,215 --> 00:05:29,362
It's like you don't even want to fight me

119
00:05:29,413 --> 00:05:30,032
All right then

120
00:05:30,082 --> 00:05:32,445
I'll smoke you out to fire up your fighting spirit!

121
00:05:33,143 --> 00:05:35,265
Burn... Burn hotter!

122
00:05:35,309 --> 00:05:37,460
How's that, huh? Is it getting stuffy?

123
00:05:38,511 --> 00:05:40,387
- Come on, if you can't take it...
- Yan...

124
00:05:40,438 --> 00:05:42,179
Break free from those ropes and fight me!

125
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:50,040
I'll have to use my gas mask

126
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,359
Whoops, lost my footing!

127
00:05:54,816 --> 00:05:56,990
This move is the Bone-Shrinking Escape!

128
00:06:00,122 --> 00:06:03,040
Shishimaru, I knew you were tailing us all along!

129
00:06:03,456 --> 00:06:05,093
Where is that Koga ninja cat?

130
00:06:05,144 --> 00:06:06,642
I promised Kenichi beforehand

131
00:06:06,692 --> 00:06:09,352
that I wouldn't fight Kemumaki, so I held back

132
00:06:09,403 --> 00:06:11,443
But when it comes to that ninja cat

133
00:06:11,484 --> 00:06:13,184
I'm definitely not going easy on him!

134
00:06:14,003 --> 00:06:15,171
What is this?

135
00:06:15,537 --> 00:06:17,960
Why is there a weird cat in my backpack?

136
00:06:21,996 --> 00:06:24,830
A ninja doesn't lie, but one must have principles!

137
00:06:29,813 --> 00:06:32,840
"The Battle for the Movie Tickets"

138
00:06:44,429 --> 00:06:46,833
Yumeko, I have two movie tickets!

139
00:06:46,883 --> 00:06:47,730
Let's go watch a movie together

140
00:06:47,781 --> 00:06:49,961
Let's go see a movie together this Sunday!

141
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,813
The movie looks really good

142
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:55,014
I have two movie tickets too!

143
00:06:55,055 --> 00:06:56,708
Why don't you come with me, okay?

144
00:06:58,215 --> 00:06:59,990
With both of you inviting me

145
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,284
what am I supposed to do?

146
00:07:01,325 --> 00:07:02,556
Kenichi doesn't even sound sincere

147
00:07:02,606 --> 00:07:04,596
I was the one who asked Yumeko first!

148
00:07:04,646 --> 00:07:06,019
No... Actually

149
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:08,326
I was already planning to ask Yumeko out this morning!

150
00:07:08,377 --> 00:07:09,616
Stop fighting, you two!

151
00:07:09,666 --> 00:07:12,400
Let me think about it, and I'll let you know once I'm home

152
00:07:12,643 --> 00:07:13,656
Bye-bye!

153
00:07:15,719 --> 00:07:17,900
Here, wear my new shoes!

154
00:07:18,791 --> 00:07:20,646
Yumeko, let me carry your schoolbag

155
00:07:20,687 --> 00:07:22,440
No need, the bag is really heavy

156
00:07:22,481 --> 00:07:23,858
Not at all, it's fine...

157
00:07:26,684 --> 00:07:29,259
Kenichi, you really are clumsy!

158
00:07:29,464 --> 00:07:30,880
I'm so sorry!

159
00:07:36,486 --> 00:07:38,213
Kagechiyo, you're just in time!

160
00:07:38,264 --> 00:07:40,180
I have a task for you to take care of

161
00:07:45,652 --> 00:07:48,822
Maybe Yumeko decided
to go with Kemumaki...

162
00:07:48,869 --> 00:07:51,334
Kenichi, Yumeko is on the phone for you!

163
00:07:51,375 --> 00:07:52,460
Coming!

164
00:07:55,863 --> 00:07:57,333
Hello, this is Kenichi!

165
00:07:57,374 --> 00:07:58,491
How are you doing, Kenichi?

166
00:07:58,658 --> 00:07:59,699
Yumeko, is that you?

167
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,560
Did you decide to go to the movies with me?

168
00:08:01,611 --> 00:08:02,620
Not just that

169
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:04,337
I really wanted to hear your voice right now

170
00:08:05,302 --> 00:08:07,073
Dummy, it's me!

171
00:08:09,696 --> 00:08:12,066
Hey... Those tickets are mine, hey!

172
00:08:12,123 --> 00:08:14,516
Hey, don't run away! Hey!

173
00:08:19,276 --> 00:08:22,031
Give them back! Give them back to me!

174
00:08:24,494 --> 00:08:27,760
Iga ninja Hattori-kun awaits your arrival!

175
00:08:27,950 --> 00:08:30,106
Hattori-kun, catch him quick!

176
00:08:30,147 --> 00:08:32,361
Oh no, this is the "Five-Way Bind"!

177
00:08:37,886 --> 00:08:40,323
Koga ninja Kemumaki has snatched the movie tickets!

178
00:08:40,373 --> 00:08:42,150
- You don't object, do you?
- Kemumaki, give them back!

179
00:08:42,201 --> 00:08:43,815
Give them back right now!

180
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,819
Ninja Technique: Super Cannonball!

181
00:08:49,552 --> 00:08:51,280
He got away!

182
00:08:52,610 --> 00:08:54,237
Yan...

183
00:08:54,667 --> 00:08:56,914
Kenichi, as if I'd let him get away that easily!

184
00:08:57,482 --> 00:08:59,948
Ripped to shreds, now my dream has come true!

185
00:09:01,025 --> 00:09:02,350
Now Kenichi doesn't have a ticket

186
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:04,336
So I can ask Yumeko out to the movies!

187
00:09:09,703 --> 00:09:10,991
This makes me so mad!

188
00:09:11,065 --> 00:09:12,595
Kenichi, follow me!

189
00:09:14,368 --> 00:09:16,800
Oh no, Hattori-kun is catching up!

190
00:09:18,713 --> 00:09:20,320
Ouch, that hurts!

191
00:09:25,369 --> 00:09:26,695
Yan...

192
00:09:26,746 --> 00:09:29,040
Yan...

193
00:09:34,775 --> 00:09:36,069
Damn it!

194
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,040
Take this!

195
00:09:37,730 --> 00:09:39,440
Yan...

196
00:09:45,036 --> 00:09:47,320
Yan...

197
00:09:54,311 --> 00:09:56,454
Go up... ouch...

198
00:10:01,891 --> 00:10:03,357
Why don't you go get it?

199
00:10:05,362 --> 00:10:06,403
Yan...

200
00:10:06,451 --> 00:10:08,000
I'm not giving you this ticket no matter what!

201
00:10:08,044 --> 00:10:09,935
Hold on tight, we're gonna fall!

202
00:10:09,976 --> 00:10:11,120
Yan...

203
00:10:11,171 --> 00:10:12,960
Oh no... we're doomed...

204
00:10:14,408 --> 00:10:15,839
Oh no, it fell!

205
00:10:25,085 --> 00:10:27,084
-Ninja Technique: Water Crossing!
-Of course I can do it!

206
00:10:32,543 --> 00:10:34,919
Huh? I saw the ticket blow over around here

207
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:36,278
Oh! Over there!

208
00:10:49,533 --> 00:10:50,359
Here's my chance!

209
00:10:57,504 --> 00:10:58,517
Yan!

210
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:03,088
Hattori-kun!

211
00:11:10,221 --> 00:11:12,240
Oh no, the ticket is ruined!

212
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,597
What should we do?

213
00:11:20,603 --> 00:11:24,360
Huh? Both of your tickets got torn up?

214
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,427
-Yeah
-Yeah

215
00:11:25,477 --> 00:11:27,954
I was originally planning for the three of us to watch the movie together

216
00:11:28,004 --> 00:11:30,449
Look, I even prepared some snacks!

217
00:11:30,490 --> 00:11:32,320
Kenichi!

218
00:11:32,711 --> 00:11:33,303
Look at this!

219
00:11:33,354 --> 00:11:36,216
I found two movie tickets for you, they're complimentary passes!

220
00:11:37,123 --> 00:11:37,960
Really?

221
00:11:38,011 --> 00:11:39,620
Here, they're yours!

222
00:11:39,786 --> 00:11:41,920
Shinzo, thank you so much!

223
00:11:42,346 --> 00:11:43,914
Wait, what is this?

224
00:11:43,955 --> 00:11:45,400
Oh, it's for a puppet show?

225
00:11:45,451 --> 00:11:47,156
I'm not watching this!

226
00:11:47,657 --> 00:11:49,242
Wait, the tickets are useless?

227
00:11:49,293 --> 00:11:51,090
I saw how sad you looked, Kenichi

228
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:53,372
I went through so much trouble to find them!

229
00:11:53,422 --> 00:11:55,624
I don't even like puppet shows

230
00:11:56,217 --> 00:11:58,482
But I didn't know you didn't like them!

231
00:11:58,532 --> 00:12:01,600
Shinzo, I'll go watch it with you

232
00:12:02,368 --> 00:12:03,219
You'll go with me?

233
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:04,032
That's right

234
00:12:04,083 --> 00:12:05,333
Now, as for the two of you...

235
00:12:05,373 --> 00:12:07,520
Since you like movies, you should just go together

236
00:12:09,182 --> 00:12:10,865
-We're off!
-Okay!

237
00:12:10,916 --> 00:12:12,762
-Yumeko!
-Yumeko!

238
00:12:20,463 --> 00:12:23,675
A girl's mind is truly the hardest thing to understand

239
00:12:23,718 --> 00:12:25,108
Yan...

240
00:12:27,674 --> 00:12:30,013
"Hitting the Jackpot"

241
00:12:35,309 --> 00:12:37,008
If I make this move, then this happens

242
00:12:37,058 --> 00:12:38,760
If I make that move, then that happens

243
00:12:39,383 --> 00:12:41,524
All right, I'll go with this move

244
00:12:43,378 --> 00:12:45,506
That's it! If I make this move, I'll win!

245
00:12:45,544 --> 00:12:47,612
Hattori-kun, you're definitely going to lose this time!

246
00:12:49,497 --> 00:12:51,297
Hey, it's your turn to move

247
00:12:51,917 --> 00:12:53,840
If it's my turn, I'll move right here

248
00:12:55,106 --> 00:12:57,538
Oh no, I lost!

249
00:12:58,765 --> 00:12:59,629
Kenichi

250
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:01,622
Could you help me mail this letter, please?

251
00:13:01,672 --> 00:13:02,878
Sure...

252
00:13:03,525 --> 00:13:04,729
The game isn't finished yet!

253
00:13:04,876 --> 00:13:06,389
Let's finish it later

254
00:13:07,488 --> 00:13:10,541
He took the chance to run off right at the deciding moment!

255
00:13:19,519 --> 00:13:21,812
Dear God, Buddha, Bodhisattva...

256
00:13:21,862 --> 00:13:23,982
Please bless me and let me win the prize!

257
00:13:24,023 --> 00:13:26,129
I really love these things, please!

258
00:13:26,179 --> 00:13:27,581
Oh, Kenichi!

259
00:13:29,268 --> 00:13:30,588
You saw me...

260
00:13:32,302 --> 00:13:34,939
I... I'll pray for you to win the prize too!

261
00:13:34,989 --> 00:13:38,880
It's not that easy, with so many applicants it's basically impossible to win

262
00:13:41,232 --> 00:13:43,812
So did you fill out a lot of entry forms?

263
00:13:43,863 --> 00:13:46,270
Yeah, I filled out about 50 in total

264
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,807
50 cards?

265
00:13:48,096 --> 00:13:51,257
The money you spent on postcards
is already enough to buy the prize

266
00:13:51,298 --> 00:13:53,516
That's no good, toy shops nowadays...

267
00:13:53,557 --> 00:13:55,800
...don't sell this kind of prize anymore

268
00:13:55,850 --> 00:13:56,770
Really?

269
00:13:58,344 --> 00:13:59,111
To be honest...

270
00:13:59,152 --> 00:14:01,702
I really, truly want to get it

271
00:14:01,752 --> 00:14:03,920
It would be so wonderful if I won!

272
00:14:07,782 --> 00:14:08,824
All right

273
00:14:19,023 --> 00:14:20,327
That's almost enough money

274
00:14:20,377 --> 00:14:23,004
Kenichi, what on earth are you still doing?

275
00:14:23,045 --> 00:14:24,856
It's your turn to move now, hurry up!

276
00:14:24,907 --> 00:14:26,812
Hold on... to be honest...

277
00:14:26,853 --> 00:14:29,155
How am I in the mood to play a game with you right now?

278
00:14:29,206 --> 00:14:31,382
One, two... oh no

279
00:14:32,432 --> 00:14:33,716
Kenichi!

280
00:14:33,766 --> 00:14:36,160
What on earth is going on?

281
00:14:40,143 --> 00:14:42,158
Yan...

282
00:14:44,569 --> 00:14:47,993
"Sleeping Beauty doll is your best partner"?

283
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:49,215
Oh? Kenichi...

284
00:14:49,262 --> 00:14:52,007
Why are you acting so girly, entering this kind of contest?

285
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,182
Mind your own business!

286
00:14:53,223 --> 00:14:55,300
Don't just stand there like a log, hurry up and help!

287
00:14:55,351 --> 00:14:56,100
Yan...

288
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:58,054
I have absolutely no interest in this sort of thing

289
00:14:58,104 --> 00:15:00,826
It's not for me, it's for Yumeko!

290
00:15:00,877 --> 00:15:02,224
So that's how it is

291
00:15:02,275 --> 00:15:04,360
You're doing this for Yumeko, aren't you?

292
00:15:04,410 --> 00:15:05,688
All right, as for this matter...

293
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:08,912
I will definitely help you take care of it, don't worry

294
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:12,594
Come on, toss the postcards up into the sky!

295
00:15:13,325 --> 00:15:14,480
Like this?

296
00:15:16,946 --> 00:15:19,400
Yan...

297
00:15:27,931 --> 00:15:29,511
Hattori-kun, is he here yet?

298
00:15:29,552 --> 00:15:31,953
Not yet, I've been waiting for a long time and haven't seen him

299
00:15:34,466 --> 00:15:35,880
Kenichi, he's here!

300
00:15:37,971 --> 00:15:39,104
Ah, yes, here he comes!

301
00:15:45,410 --> 00:15:46,744
Is it here? Is it here?

302
00:15:46,795 --> 00:15:48,570
Check the address carefully first

303
00:15:48,621 --> 00:15:49,680
It's not

304
00:15:51,997 --> 00:15:53,329
There's no hope at all

305
00:15:53,470 --> 00:15:55,000
Why is there no hope at all?

306
00:15:55,368 --> 00:15:56,940
This is a lucky draw, after all

307
00:15:56,991 --> 00:15:58,948
The results come out every week

308
00:15:59,004 --> 00:16:01,393
I sent so many letters, so if I don't get a prize today...

309
00:16:01,443 --> 00:16:03,152
That means I came up empty, right?

310
00:16:03,203 --> 00:16:05,091
The most important thing in life is having confidence

311
00:16:05,141 --> 00:16:06,641
Getting discouraged over such a small thing...

312
00:16:06,682 --> 00:16:08,375
How is that being a real man? Come on

313
00:16:08,415 --> 00:16:10,888
Just buy more postcards and enter again, right?

314
00:16:10,929 --> 00:16:12,015
I'd love to enter too

315
00:16:12,055 --> 00:16:14,545
Too bad I'm out of money to buy postcards!

316
00:16:15,169 --> 00:16:15,961
Hey, Hattori-kun

317
00:16:16,002 --> 00:16:17,572
Why don't you lend me some money, okay?

318
00:16:17,886 --> 00:16:21,116
I'd love to lend you some, but I...

319
00:16:21,176 --> 00:16:23,592
But you're flat broke too, Hattori-kun, aren't you?

320
00:16:23,633 --> 00:16:26,120
There's really nothing I can do

321
00:16:26,602 --> 00:16:28,039
There's one left!

322
00:16:31,148 --> 00:16:33,732
Let's mail this last one, okay?

323
00:16:33,783 --> 00:16:35,193
Come on, stop joking

324
00:16:35,244 --> 00:16:36,776
I didn't win even after sending dozens

325
00:16:36,826 --> 00:16:38,818
How could I win with just one now?

326
00:16:38,868 --> 00:16:42,015
Don't be like that, hope and confidence are what matter most

327
00:16:44,916 --> 00:16:45,801
Hi, Yumeko

328
00:16:45,852 --> 00:16:46,996
Oh, it's you, Kenichi

329
00:16:47,083 --> 00:16:48,732
Um... haven't you won anything yet?

330
00:16:48,773 --> 00:16:49,495
Yeah

331
00:16:49,545 --> 00:16:51,141
The more I want to win, the less I do

332
00:16:51,191 --> 00:16:53,537
It's so frustrating, I've lost all my motivation

333
00:16:54,974 --> 00:16:56,851
That little girl won again

334
00:16:56,902 --> 00:16:58,224
It's so pretty!

335
00:16:59,871 --> 00:17:02,731
She's so lucky, unlike me

336
00:17:09,384 --> 00:17:10,193
Come on

337
00:17:10,244 --> 00:17:12,268
God, Lord, Bodhisattva, please bless me

338
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:14,071
Please let me win

339
00:17:17,855 --> 00:17:20,298
Our last hope is gone too

340
00:17:21,988 --> 00:17:23,841
There's a package for you guys

341
00:17:23,901 --> 00:17:25,459
A package for me?

342
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:27,586
We did it! I won!

343
00:17:27,637 --> 00:17:29,379
I finally won!

344
00:17:29,430 --> 00:17:31,672
- Awesome!
- I told you confidence was what mattered!

345
00:17:31,712 --> 00:17:32,719
Right?

346
00:17:36,984 --> 00:17:38,031
Kenichi

347
00:17:38,104 --> 00:17:39,317
Hi, Yumeko

348
00:17:40,883 --> 00:17:43,090
I'm giving this doll to you

349
00:17:43,305 --> 00:17:44,913
Huh? Where did you get that?

350
00:17:44,964 --> 00:17:46,268
I won the lucky draw

351
00:17:46,318 --> 00:17:48,055
This is the Sleeping Beauty doll

352
00:17:48,105 --> 00:17:49,710
So what?

353
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:51,311
What did you say?

354
00:17:51,361 --> 00:17:53,943
Didn't you really want to win this prize?

355
00:17:53,993 --> 00:17:55,516
What? I really wanted it?

356
00:17:55,557 --> 00:17:56,163
Yeah

357
00:17:56,213 --> 00:17:58,980
You even sent in dozens of postcards for it

358
00:17:59,031 --> 00:18:00,086
You've got it wrong

359
00:18:00,137 --> 00:18:01,670
I didn't want the grand prize

360
00:18:01,721 --> 00:18:03,950
I wanted the brooch from third prize

361
00:18:08,225 --> 00:18:10,830
Actually, I've already won first prize twice

362
00:18:10,930 --> 00:18:12,846
It's just that I've never won third prize

363
00:18:12,889 --> 00:18:14,839
That's why I really wanted to win it

364
00:18:14,896 --> 00:18:17,960
-Oh man, this is bad
-Oh man, this is bad

365
00:18:18,337 --> 00:18:21,342
This'll teach us not to meddle in girls' business

366
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,800
Yan...

